WEBVTT

00:01:00.474 --> 00:01:03.569
I wanted to be followed by a devoted team,

00:01:03.593 --> 00:01:04.993
I wanted to be right.

00:01:05.823 --> 00:01:08.523
In short, I wanted to be a hero.

00:01:09.165 --> 00:01:13.101
A hero selling chips
and biscuits in a pink suit.

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.323
(Laughter)

00:01:16.403 --> 00:01:18.536
What happened after that speech?

00:01:19.419 --> 00:01:20.569
Nothing.

00:01:21.561 --> 00:01:24.451
All of that applause
did not lead to action.

00:01:24.475 --> 00:01:25.625
Nothing changed.

00:01:26.021 --> 00:01:28.973
Not because they didn't like
me or the message.

00:01:28.997 --> 00:01:32.537
The problem was that no one knew
what they were expected to do.